                            paragraphScope="all"
                            text="Yosemite Backpacking Walking boots that you have already worn in A rucksack of 50 to 60 litres Sleeping bag and mat Warm layer, rain jacket and a sun hat Shorts and long trousers Water bottles for three litres Head torch Sunscreen Tents, stoves, food and the bear-proof canisters for storing it are provided."
